Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 20:00:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/11] EW: record post-fix timing receipts and the gate review

Two serial post-fix full-pass runs on this host clear 2/4 ms. The
Platinum reference 2.5/6.9 failure is retained. Commit-1 vs HOJ and
seeker impact-hit evidence are written up in PERFORMANCE-REVIEW.md.

Co-authored-by: Artemis2028 <Artemis2028@users.noreply.github.com>
