+projectile path without flying the shot or sampling twice. The pinned
+harness times that series at 2/4 ms, reports updateMs, electronicsPass
+and whole-frame tick separately, and emits N/A (never zero) on the
+pre-sensor tree. Keep earlier receipts with labeled boundaries.
